#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:5 a29b2fa70d124c1d86f300a37f9bae7f
msgid "RTL Mode (Return To Launch)"
msgstr "RTL 模式（返回起飞点）"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:7 3e3ab56838f040eaaaf13c35d509ec0f
msgid ""
"In RTL mode the plane will return to its home location (the point where the "
"plane armed - assuming it had GPS lock) and loiter there until given "
"alternate instructions (or it runs out of fuel!). As with :ref:`AUTO <auto-"
"mode>` mode you can also \"nudge\" the aircraft manually in this mode using "
"stick mixing (assuming the RTL was not a result of RC failsafe)."
msgstr ""
"在 RTL 模式下，飞机将返回 Home 位置（飞机解锁时的位置——假设已获得 GPS 定位），并在那里盘旋等待其他指令（或燃油耗尽！）。与 "
":ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` 模式一样，在此模式下也可以使用摇杆混控「微调」飞机（假设 RTL 不是 RC 失控保护的结果）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:13 378b2632add9495ca68a19700691abb3
msgid ""
"The target altitude for RTL mode is set using the :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE "
"<RTL_ALTITUDE>` parameter in meters. When initiated below :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE"
" <RTL_ALTITUDE>`, Plane will immediately climb at maximum allowable rate to "
"reach that altitude, if above, it will descend in a linear manner versus "
"distance to home, reaching that altitude at the home loiter point."
msgstr ""
"RTL 模式的目标高度使用 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` 参数（单位：米）设置。当在 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` 以下触发时，Plane 将立即以最大允许速率爬升至该高度；若高于该高度，则按距 "
"Home 的距离线性下降，在 Home 盘旋点达到该高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:15 472c78f49ef946a5bc4ace347e106eeb
msgid ""
"The loiter radius at home is determined by :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>`, if"
" it's non-zero, otherwise :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` is used. "
"Clock-wise or Counter-Clock-wise circling can be set by positive or negative"
" values for the radius."
msgstr ""
"在 Home 点的盘旋半径由 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 决定（若非零），否则使用 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>`。顺时针或逆时针盘旋可通过正负半径值设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:17 dc8a973bc1534635bf7020891f847f75
msgid ""
"Additionally, in firmware versions 4.0.6 and later, by setting "
":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` to a non-zero value, the plane will "
"climb that many meters, limited in bank angle by "
":ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` degrees until the additional "
"altitude is reached, then begin the above return to home action from that "
"altitude."
msgstr ""
"此外，在 4.0.6 及更高版本固件中，通过将 :ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` 设为非零值，飞机将在返回 "
"Home 动作开始前先爬升指定米数，期间坡度角受 :ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` 度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:19 5a67f961492d4bbcaf739e31d778e666
msgid ""
"To prevent the vehicle from turning until the return atlitude is reached, if"
" below that value(:ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` + "
":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`), set bit 4 of the "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bitmask."
msgstr ""
"为防止飞机在达到返回高度之前转弯（若低于该值，即 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` + "
":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`），请设置 "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 位掩码的第 4 位。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:21 e9d4134c16ff4adea8d5bd6835b5cea8
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you may :ref:`configure the plane to return to a Rally Point "
"<common-rally-points>`, rather than the home location."
msgstr "或者，您可以 :ref:`配置飞机返回集结点 <common-rally-points>`，而不是返回 Home 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:24 db08706f9800420b96893f3d51ed818d
msgid "RTL_AUTOLAND"
msgstr "RTL_AUTOLAND"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:26 0ec20849431b44878017c7ed8fdc2bea
msgid ""
"It is possible to setup an :ref:`automatic-landing` to be executed when "
"entering RTL. See :ref:`common-do-land-start` for details. You must have "
"setup your vehicle to properly do a automatic landing, of course."
msgstr ""
"可以在进入 RTL 时设置执行 :ref:`自动降落<automatic-landing>`。详情请参见 :ref:`common-do-land-"
"start`。当然，您必须已正确设置飞机以执行自动降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:30 266bc961e56a4ca5ad7f5c6014987aeb
msgid ""
"\"Home\" position is always supposed to be your Plane's actual GPS takeoff "
"location:"
msgstr "「Home」位置始终应为飞机实际的 GPS 起飞位置："

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:33 b581761daaab459896fbbd67d18b330e
msgid ""
"It is very important to acquire GPS lock before arming in order for RTL, "
"Loiter, Auto or any GPS dependent mode to work properly."
msgstr "非常重要的是，在解锁前获得 GPS 定位，以确保 RTL、Loiter、Auto 或任何 GPS 依赖模式正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:35 d76d5e6bec4746058cb7ee4f2433fd61
msgid ""
"For Plane the home position is initially established at the time the plane "
"acquires its GPS lock. It is then continuously updated as long as the "
"autopilot is disarmed."
msgstr "对于 Plane，Home 位置最初在飞机获得 GPS 定位时建立，之后在飞控未解锁期间持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:39 600e2ecdda6e46589d26ddb2456a7b4a
msgid ""
"This means if you execute an RTL in Plane, it will return to the location "
"where it was when it was armed - assuming it had acquired GPS lock."
msgstr "这意味着若在 Plane 中执行 RTL，飞机将返回解锁时的位置——假设已获得 GPS 定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:42 5704e782367c442fa06bf38ab9f0f792
msgid ""
"Consider the use of :ref:`Rally Points <common-rally-points>` to avoid "
"returning directly to your arming point on RTL"
msgstr "考虑使用 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 以避免 RTL 时直接返回解锁点"
